# Atlas Core Dashboard Density & Layout Latency Reduction Spec
**Author:** Onyx Fontaine  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D9 15:55  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Design token refactor and component DOM flattening specification to simplify Atlas Core visual hierarchy and cut layout thrashing.

